Sun Gallant 12x22 console font -- attribution and license
==========================================================

The glyph data in gallant-font.nix is GENERATED (by gallant-bdf-to-nix.awk, run
from gallant-font.nix) from the Sun Gallant Demi 12x22 bitmap font as vendored in
the illumos-gate source tree:

    usr/src/data/consfonts/Gallant19.bdf

pinned to illumos-gate commit
    4b529e40b9b8c5bcd0a4bc923a168c7988b72748
    (sha256-SkAjTLzO+UY8Gb+W7wShLSVC7VEQONpIAwqqU3IGZSY=)
fetched from
    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/illumos/illumos-gate/4b529e40b9b8c5bcd0a4bc923a168c7988b72748/usr/src/data/consfonts/Gallant19.bdf

The BDF header records its provenance:

    COMMENT Copyright 2006 Sun Microsystems, Inc.  All rights reserved.
    COMMENT Use is subject to license terms.
    COMMENT This is a derivation of a BDF font from the X consolidation
    COMMENT Originally a BSD vfont.
    COMMENT Re-built BDF and ISO10646-1 from hex code originally in
    COMMENT illumos usr/src/uts/common/font/12x22.c
    FONT -Sun-Gallant-Demi-R-Normal--19-190-72-72-C-120-ISO10646-1
    FONTBOUNDINGBOX 12 22 0 -5

